{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01222","headline":"相和歌辞  豫章行 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞  豫章行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡风吹代马，北拥鲁阳关。\n吴兵照海雪，西讨何时还？\n半渡上辽津，黄云惨无颜。\n老母与子别，呼天野草间。\n白马绕旌旗，悲鸣相追攀。\n白杨秋月苦，早落豫章山。\n本爲休明人，斩虏素不闲。\n岂惜战鬬死，爲君埽凶顽。\n精感石没羽，岂忘惮险艰。\n楼船若鲸飞，波荡落星湾。\n此曲不可奏，三军鬓成斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}